modern warfare 2's worldwide reveal gets  an official date and battlefield 2042  season 1 reveal might be coming next  week  the big world premiere of call of duty  modern warfare 2 is close so close it's  less than a week away on june 8th in an  effort to build further hype for the  game activision released a live action  trailer that shows a group of soldiers  task force 141 preparing to go behind  enemy lines the teaser ends with text  that reads the ultimate weapon is team  however it should have said the ultimate  weapon is steam i say this because  charlie intel recently spotted modern  warfare 2 artwork on steam and many are  taking this as a sign that the franchise  might make its way back to valve's  platform at some point in the future the  page containing the artwork has now  seemingly been updated to remove the  modern warfare 2 imagery but don't give  up hope just yet steam's twitter account  further fueled the speculation earlier  today by quote tweeting the new modern  warfare 2 teaser trailer along with the  eyes emoji while still not quite an  official confirmation it now seems all  but guaranteed that you can expect to  find modern warfare 2 on steam and while  we're on the subject of steam valve has  announced a delay for the steam deck  docking station due to a shortage of  parts luckily those who have pre-ordered  a steam deck like me don't have to worry  about the dock's delay impacting any  timelines as they use parts from  different factories heading back to the  fps news according to tom henderson  battlefield 2042's long-awaited season 1  update will be revealed officially next  week the reveal could happen possibly  with an accompanying trailer on june 7th  with impressions from media and other  sources going live on june 8th henderson  reported that play tests for season 1  have been going on extensively over the  past few weeks and one big change in  season 1 could be around specialists as  fans know 2042 did away with the  traditional class-based battlefield  approach in favor of specialist  characters the extent of any changes to  the system in the season 1 update are  unknown but henderson said a new  specialist character named evelina elise  could arrive in the new season  battlefield 2042's post-launch content  has been scaled back so dice could focus  on improving the game's core issues  additionally some developers have  already shifted to the next battlefield  game which could launch in 2024 as for  when season 1 might launch henderson  said it's on tap for release in the next  two weeks are you still playing  battlefield 2042 if so how often let me  know in the comments and if military  games aren't your thing and you somehow  made it this far into the video you  might be happy to know that bioware has  officially revealed the title for the  next dragon age game the new entry in  the series will be called dragon age  dread wolf confirming a strong  connection to a well-known character in  dragon age lore and though the game is  named after an established character the  studio said newcomers to the dragon age  world will still be able to understand  his schemes as they play the game and  although it isn't releasing in 2022  bioware promised we'll see more of  dragon age dread wolf sometime later  this year hit the comment section and  rank all of the dragon age games for me  and i'll see you tomorrow  [Music]  you
 

